# Mutation plan for D-1150 (this server's limiters decide for forwarded requests too, and Go keys on
# the client) and D-1151 (the per-user step on the web client's pages and Go's web routes).
#
#   MUTATE_PACKAGE=mm-api scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/ratelimit-front.plan
#
# Not planned: the over-long-URL skip in `per_user_step` (no parity row sends a URL past
# MaximumURLLength with a token under VaryByUser); the request and version ids on an API-kind
# refusal (per-process values, filtered by every comparison).

